OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer counting the cost of house
OL,4,Aram tractor theft
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farmer whose tractor was stolen and
OL,7,Frammed into a house says the ordeal has
OL,8,Fcost him both emotionally and
OL,9,Ffinancially.
OL,11,FIan Tate said the first he knew of the
OL,12,Ftheft from his farm near Yarm was the
OL,13,Fpolice knocking on his door at 03:00
OL,14,FBST on 9 May to say his tractor was
OL,15,Fembedded in a house nine miles (14.5km)
OL,16,Faway in Middlesbrough.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
