OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer counting the cost of house
OL,4,Aram tractor theft
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe thief, 28-year-old Nathan Blagg,
OL,7,Fhas been jailed for more than seven
OL,8,Fyears, with Teesside Crown Court
OL,9,Fhearing he targeted the family home of
OL,10,Fa rival who had urinated on his
OL,11,Ffather's grave.
OL,13,FTate told the BBC he was thousands of
OL,14,Fpounds out of pocket, adding: "It's the
OL,15,Fway of the world at the moment, nothing
OL,16,Fis safe."
